 "floorplan_why": "7 macros (2 x 171.3 x 77.8 staging, 5 x 94.8 x 41.1 response queue = 46k um2) + ~20.6k flops. Flow E -> W: VM response pins (1,026 b) on E -> response queue macros -> ratio FIFO -> staging macros -> vm_rq flops and the WFC pins (584 b) on W. >= 20 um channels around every macro; the tile is macro-bound (std utilisation low by construction). Placement W -> E: staging macros stacked at x 22.5 (rd_out on their W face, 20 um from the W pins), a ~82 um standard-cell band (ratio FIFO, output buffer), response-queue macros in two columns at x 276.5 / 391.4, the E 20 um strip for the 1,026 response pin flops.",
